type: software
title: "ArcGIS Pro MCP"
abstract: >-
  An ArcGIS Pro add-in that runs a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server inside the
  application, so that any MCP-compatible AI client can work on the open project
  through named tools, geoprocessing tools by name, or ArcPy code run in process.
